    "deviceLimit.removed": {
      "comment": "DeviceLimit, the Replace a device flow (SIGN-IN.md §3.7): the license is on all its devices. Arguments: {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”; {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated). Arguments: 1=device, 2=product.",
