      "comment": "Terminal sign-in (SIGN-IN.md §4.15). Plain text, no formatting. Arguments: {license} = the license's name, usually product and tier; {term} = the license term (one of the signin.term.* strings); {device} = a device's friendly name, for example “Maya's MacBook”; {position} = the device's seat number, as a number; {limit} = the license's device limit, as a number. Arguments: 1=license, 2=term, 3=device, 4=position, 5=limit.",
